12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Premature accusations often backfire. Let us gather more data first.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,Patience is a virtue. The truth reveals itself to those who wait.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
